  "description": "The META POWER TR V4 BOSCH ÖHLINS EDITION showcases the performance of ÖHLINS suspension.\n• An RXF 36 Air fork features an air spring equipped with Ramp Up Chamber which allows for fine-tuning. The hydraulic cartridge offers high and low speed adjustments as well as rebound damping. The TTX Air shock is clean and dynamic. It has been designed to best adapt to our kinematics.\n• For a clean feel, stopping power is provided with SHIMANO XT 4-piston brakes and 220mm discs.\n• High-end DT SWISS HX1700 aluminium wheels are specifically designed for e-MTB use and hand-assembled by the Swiss brand. Strong and reliable.\n• A robust and reliable SHIMANO XT 12-speed drivetrain completes the buil",
